{"categories":[],"data_as_of":"2026-09-18T23:04:17Z","description":"本站近 30 天收录的 cs.MA 相关证据与变化。","evidence":[{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_aaa8a002ca28d7267ed2d2ddb7dcf6e7d6c5b5172fcef45d29f462baa761ac23","internal_url":"/posts/20260916-arxiv-agentic-societies-need-a-social-harness-0-64867fe359/","observation_id":"obs_64867fe3591d571b73b5736dd231ef43b3130dd16365b35bd545ee73afefc045","published_at":"2026-09-15T17:57:27Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"当前保存的是来源摘要，不代表论文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"Agentic Societies Need a Social Harness"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_939573c6019e133c0a320af9b60c02d03f019cbd0f3e9d5fa81cf1a711f63238","internal_url":"/posts/20260910-arxiv-copying-explains-the-collective-behavior-of-ai-age-3-c03d0a860a/","observation_id":"obs_c03d0a860a609f6071c68df99b9cc2f2878b5f96641d1a1243e5806cb9237abb","published_at":"2026-09-08T17:59:20Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"该研究通过公开的编辑日志分析了大量 AI 代理在共享百科页面上进行写入的行为，发现代理几乎完全依赖环境中已出现的内容来选择写入位置、自己名称以及消息措辞。","title":"Copying explains the collective behavior of AI agents in the wild"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_e001b631c5d7b6bddb6f8b18a7057e369f9981383cd69cb2028ea53ed7a71398","internal_url":"/posts/20260825-arxiv-the-interaction-tax-when-communication-erases-dive-2-46e0453319/","observation_id":"obs_46e0453319385edf26c4d13c6616fa4684478d4c89ffafe513eae48b32f19c12","published_at":"2026-08-24T17:45:15Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"该文提出“多交互税”（interaction tax）概念：当多个大语言模型代理相互读取完整答案时，方案在单轮内趋于相同，失去多样性。作者在匹配预算的若干验证任务上比较全答案交互与独立生成，发现全答案交互效果弱，独立生成可保持思路分散，从而避免多样性崩溃。","title":"The Interaction Tax: When Communication Erases Diversity in Multi-Agent Teams"}],"graph_node_id":"tag:cs.MA","id":"tag:cs.MA","related_topics":[{"cooccurrence":3,"graph_node_id":"tag:AI Agent","id":"tag:AI Agent","jaccard":1.0,"topic":"AI Agent"}],"scenarios":[],"schema_version":"stack_trends_topic_v2","sour